          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>Terms of Service</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>Terms of Service of AMP Joint-10™</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><br>**Last Updated: May 19, 2026**\n<br>\n<br>Welcome to the AMP Joint website. By accessing or using our website, services, features, or content, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms of Service (\"Terms\"). These Terms establish the conditions governing your use of the AMP Joint website.\n<br>\n<br>If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, please discontinue using this website immediately. By continuing to use this website, you also confirm that you are at least 18 years of age. Individuals under the age of 18 are not permitted to use this website.\n<br>\n<br>## Changes to These Terms\n<br>\n<br>AMP Joint reserves the right to revise, modify, or update these Terms at any time and at its sole discretion. Any changes become effective immediately upon being posted on this website. We encourage you to review these Terms periodically to stay informed of any updates. Your continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.\n<br>\n<br>## Website Access and Security\n<br>\n<br>While we make every effort to keep our website available and functioning properly, we cannot guarantee uninterrupted or error-free access at all times. AMP Joint may update, suspend, restrict, or discontinue any part of the website, temporarily or permanently, without prior notice. Certain areas of the website may occasionally be restricted, including sections available to registered users.\n<br>\n<br>### Your Responsibilities\n<br>\n<br>When accessing this website, you agree to:\n<br>\n<br>* Maintain the internet connection, devices, and software necessary to access the website.\n<br>* Ensure that anyone using the website through your internet connection or device complies with these Terms.\n<br>* Provide accurate, complete, and current information whenever requested.\n<br>* Keep your account credentials, including your username and password, secure and confidential.\n<br>* Notify us promptly if you believe your account has been accessed or used without authorization.\n<br>\n<br>## Consent to Receive Communications\n<br>\n<br>By using our website or services, you consent to receive communications from AMP Joint through phone calls, SMS/MMS messages, and email regarding product updates, service notifications, promotional offers, and other relevant information. If you wish to modify your communication preferences or withdraw your consent, please contact our customer support team.\n<br>\n<br>## Intellectual Property Rights\n<br>\n<br>All content available on the AMP Joint website—including text, graphics, images, logos, software, videos, designs, and other materials—is protected under applicable intellectual property laws and remains the property of AMP Joint or its licensed partners.\n<br>\n<br>You are granted a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access and use the website solely for your personal, non-commercial use. You may not reproduce, modify, distribute, publish, display, or otherwise exploit any content from this website without prior written authorization.\n<br>\n<br>If downloadable software or applications are made available, you may download a single copy for your personal use, subject to any applicable license agreements.\n<br>\n<br>## Prohibited Activities\n<br>\n<br>When using the AMP Joint website, you agree not to:\n<br>\n<br>* Engage in any unlawful, deceptive, fraudulent, or harmful activities.\n<br>* Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the website, servers, or security systems.\n<br>* Use automated software, bots, crawlers, or scripts to interact with the website without authorization.\n<br>* Upload, distribute, or transmit viruses, malware, ransomware, or other malicious code.\n<br>* Interfere with, disrupt, damage, or impair the operation, security, or performance of the website.\n<br>\n<br>Violation of these restrictions may result in the immediate suspension or termination of your access and may also subject you to legal action where permitted by law.\n<br>\n<br>## Disclaimer of Warranties\n<br>\n<br>The AMP Joint website and all associated content, products, and services are provided on an \"as is\" and \"as available\" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied.\n<br>\n<br>AMP Joint makes no representations regarding the accuracy, completeness, reliability, or availability of the website or its content. We do not guarantee that the website will always operate without interruptions, technical errors, security vulnerabilities, or harmful components.\n<br>\n<br>## Limitation of Liability\n<br>\n<br>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, AMP Joint shall not be responsible for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or punitive damages resulting from your access to or inability to use the website.\n<br>\n<br>This limitation includes, without limitation, damages relating to lost profits, lost data, business interruption, revenue loss, or other intangible losses arising from the use of this website.\n<br>\n<br>## Indemnification\n<br>\n<br>You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless AMP Joint, together with its affiliates, employees, officers, agents, contractors, licensors, and business partners, from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, costs, or expenses, including reasonable legal fees, resulting from:\n<br>\n<br>* Your use of the website;\n<br>* Your violation of these Terms;\n<br>* Your violation of applicable laws or regulations; or\n<br>* Your infringement of the rights of any third party.\n<br>\n<br>## Governing Law and Jurisdiction\n<br>\n<br>These Terms of Service shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of the United States.\n<br>\n<br>Any dispute arising from or relating to these Terms or your use of the website shall be resolved exclusively in a court of competent jurisdiction within the United States.\n<br>\n<br>## Termination\n<br>\n<br>AMP Joint reserves the right, at its sole discretion and without prior notice, to suspend or terminate your access to the website if we determine that you have violated these Terms or engaged in prohibited conduct.\n<br>\n<br>Termination of your access does not affect any rights or obligations that, by their nature, should continue after termination, including enforcement of these Terms.\n<br>\n<br>## Entire Agreement\n<br>\n<br>These Terms of Service, together with our Privacy Policy and any additional legal notices published on the AMP Joint website, constitute the complete agreement between you and AMP Joint regarding your use of this website.\n<br>\n<br>They supersede all previous communications, understandings, representations, or agreements, whether oral or written, relating to the subject matter contained herein.\n<br>\n<br>## Feedback and Suggestions\n<br>\n<br>We welcome your comments, ideas, recommendations, and suggestions regarding our website and services.\n<br>\n<br>By submitting feedback, you acknowledge that AMP Joint may use, modify, reproduce, publish, or implement your feedback without restriction or compensation, and that submitting feedback does not grant you any ownership or intellectual property rights.\n<br>\n<br>## Contact Information\n<br>\n<br>If you have any questions, concerns, or require assistance regarding these Terms of Service, please contact us at:\n<br>\n<br>**📧 [support@AMPJoint.com](mailto:support@AMPJoint.com)**\n<br>\n<br>By accessing or using the AMP Joint website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to comply with these Terms of Service and accept responsibility for following all guidelines and conditions described above.&nbsp;<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
