          "_name": "article18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article><b>AMP Joint-10</b> is a joint health supplement featuring a 10-ingredient formula designed to address multiple aspects of joint function.\n<div>\n</div><div>Key compounds include glucosamine sulfate, chondroitin sulfate, MSM, turmeric, boswellia, and hyaluronic acid.\n</div><div>The supplement is intended to ease occasional joint discomfort, support cartilage integrity, and promote healthy inflammatory response.\n</div><div>Available exclusively on the official website, it comes in three packages with a <b>60-day money-back guarantee</b>.\n</div><div>Most users take two capsules daily, and the formula is generally well-tolerated with minimal reported side effects.\n</div><div>It is not a replacement for medical treatment; consult a healthcare professional before starting any new supplement.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
