          "_name": "article18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article><b>AMP Joint-10</b> is a dietary supplement formulated to support joint health, mobility, and flexibility. Manufactured in the <b>United States</b> in an <b>FDA-registered</b>, <b>GMP-certified facility</b>, the product comes in easy-to-swallow capsules. Each bottle contains a 30-day supply.\n<div>\n</div><div>The supplement’s defining feature is its ingredient count: exactly 10 natural and synthetic compounds selected to target different layers of joint function. These include structural building blocks like glucosamine and chondroitin, anti-inflammatory herbs like turmeric and boswellia, and lubricating agents such as hyaluronic acid. The combination is intended to work synergistically — some ingredients provide the raw materials for cartilage repair, while others help manage the inflammatory cycle that can accelerate joint wear.\n</div><div>Unlike single-compound joint supplements, <b>AMP Joint-10</b> takes a multi-target approach. This strategy is grounded in the idea that joint discomfort is rarely caused by one isolated factor, so an effective supplement should address several mechanisms at once.</div><div>\n</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
