          "_name": "article18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>Healthy joints rely on a delicate balance: cartilage cushions the bones, synovial fluid lubricates the space, and muscles and tendons stabilize the structure. Over time — or due to injury, repetitive stress, or aging — that balance can shift. Cartilage thins, fluid loses viscosity, and low-grade inflammation sets in, leading to stiffness and reduced range of motion.\n<div>\n</div><div><b>AMP Joint-10</b>’s formula is designed to intervene at several of these points.\n</div><div>First, structural ingredients like glucosamine sulfate and chondroitin sulfate supply the molecular precursors needed to maintain and possibly rebuild cartilage matrix. Multiple studies suggest these compounds can slow cartilage breakdown, particularly in knee osteoarthritis, though results vary between individuals.\n</div><div>Second, anti-inflammatory and antioxidant ingredients — turmeric, boswellia, quercetin, and ginger — help modulate the body’s inflammatory response. Chronic, low-level inflammation is a key driver of joint degradation, and dampening that response may reduce pain signaling and protect joint tissues from further damage.\n</div><div>Third, lubricating and cushioning agents like methylsulfonylmethane (MSM) and hyaluronic acid support synovial fluid quality. MSM provides bioavailable sulfur, essential for collagen synthesis, while hyaluronic acid acts as a shock absorber and lubricant within the joint capsule.\n</div><div>Together, this approach doesn’t just mask symptoms; it aims to create an environment where joints can function more comfortably day to day.</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
