            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".img-wrapper": {
              "width": "10rem",
              "padding-right": "1.5rem"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features033",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features033\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' &amp;&amp; bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Images\" name=\"showImage\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected=\"\">3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax=\"\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected=\"\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked=\"\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Ingredient</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTo add more cards, hover on a card and click 'Add items'\n\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}} active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Ingredient</b><br><b><br></b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><b>Glucosamine Sulfate</b></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Function in Joint Health</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Provides building blocks for cartilage repair; may slow joint space narrowing.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\" data-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Key Research Notes</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Multiple clinical trials support its use in mild-to-moderate knee osteoarthritis.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop4.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"3\" data-bs-slide-to=\"3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Chondroitin Sulfate</b><b><br></b><br><b><br></b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><br><br><b>MSM (Methylsulfonylmethane)</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop6.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\" data-slide-to=\"4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Attracts water into cartilage, improving shock absorption; inhibits cartilage-degrading enzymes.<br><br></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">Supplies organic sulfur for collagen and keratin synthesis; reduces oxidative stress.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop5.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Often paired with glucosamine; shown to modestly reduce pain and improve function.<br><br></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br>Demonstrated significant pain reduction and improved physical function in knee OA studies.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\" data-slide-to=\"6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><br><b>Turmeric (Curcumin)</b><br><br><b><br></b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b><br></b><b>Boswellia Serrata</b><br><br><br><br><br><br><b>Ginger Root Extract</b><br><br><br><br><b>Hyaluronic Acid</b><br><br><br><br><br><b>BioPerine® (Black Pepper Extract)</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-bs-slide-to=\"8\" data-slide-to=\"7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Potent anti-inflammatory; inhibits COX-2 and NF-κB pathways.</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><br>Blocks 5-lipoxygenase, an enzyme involved in inflammation; may preserve cartilage.<br><br><br>Inhibits prostaglandins and leukotrienes; provides analgesic effects.<br><br>Major component of synovial fluid; acts as lubricant and shock absorber.<br><br><br>Enhances bioavailability of curcumin and other nutrients; not direct joint action but crucial for efficacy.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"../_images/shop/shop1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-bs-slide-to=\"7\" data-slide-to=\"8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">Meta-analyses show it can be as effective as some NSAIDs for joint pain, with better safety.</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  <br>Clinically shown to reduce pain and improve joint function in osteoarthritis patients.<br><br><br><br>Some trials report improved knee pain after consistent daily supplementation.<br><br>Oral supplementation may improve knee function in mild-to-moderate cases, though absorption is debated.<br><br>Increases curcumin absorption by up to 2,000%, making the turmeric far more effective.</h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vrdrfvjceG",
          "_anchor": "features033-2d",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
