          "_name": "article18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article><p>AMP Joint-10 uses ingredients that are generally recognized as safe at the doses included. The manufacturing takes place in a facility that follows Good Manufacturing Practices (GMP), and the product is third-party tested for purity and potency, according to the official website.</p><p>\n</p><div>\n</div><div>However, no supplement is entirely without risk. Potential side effects are typically mild and may include:</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>Digestive bloating or gas (often attributed to glucosamine)\n</div><div>Mild nausea, especially if taken on an empty stomach\n</div><div>Sulfur-related burping or mild gastrointestinal discomfort from MSM\n</div><div>Increased bleeding risk potential in individuals on anticoagulant or antiplatelet medication (due to turmeric, ginger, and bromelain)</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>People with shellfish allergies should note that glucosamine is commonly derived from shellfish. Some manufacturers use a vegetarian source, but the official website does not explicitly state the source; allergy-prone individuals should verify directly or consult their doctor.</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>Pregnant or nursing women, and anyone scheduled for surgery, should avoid the supplement unless cleared by a physician.\n</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div><p></p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
