          "_name": "article18",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article18\" group=\"Article\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#9fe870\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n          <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n              <b>List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n              Press \"Enter\" to add more items to the list.\n            </h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article><b>AMP Joint-10</b> enters the market with a compelling, ingredient-dense formula that aligns with current joint health research. The inclusion of a broad spectrum of anti-inflammatory and structural support compounds, plus a bioavailability enhancer, makes it more than a standard glucosamine pill. The pricing structure, while not the cheapest, is competitive within the premium joint supplement space, and the 60-day refund window gives cautious buyers a safety net.\n<div>\n</div><div>That said, no supplement is a magic wand. Joint health responds best to a combined approach: movement (low-impact exercise like swimming or cycling), weight management, an anti-inflammatory diet, and when appropriate, a well-designed supplement. AMP Joint-10 could be a useful piece of that puzzle for many people, but it works best when expectations are realistic and consistency is maintained.\n</div><div>If you’ve done your research, understand the science, and are looking for a single product that bundles 10 evidence-supported ingredients, <b>AMP Joint-10</b> merits consideration. Just remember to loop in your doctor — especially if you have pre-existing conditions or take prescription medication — and give the formula the full 60 to 90 days before making a final judgment.\n</div><div><br></div><div>\n</div><div>\n</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
